 rooftop environment rushes behind them. At the beginning, the runner sprints toward a narrow gap between two low concrete rooftops. The camera shakes naturally with each stride and briefly dips as the runner plants one foot on the ledge. The runner jumps across the gap, tucks the knees, and lands smoothly on the opposite rooftop. Immediately after landing, the runner vaults over a waist-high metal rail while keeping the selfie camera aimed at the face. The camera tilts upward during the vault, revealing a bright blue sky, glass office towers, and the city far below. In the final moment, the runner lands in a controlled crouch, rises slightly, and gives a quick confident grin directly into the lens. Continuous single take, no cuts, realistic body physics, natural motion blur, strong sense of height and forward momentum, detailed urban textures, late-afternoon sunlight.\n\noverall_soundscape: Rapid footfalls strike concrete in sync with the running rhythm. Wind rushes strongly around the microphone during the jump, with clothing and harness straps fluttering. Shoe soles scrape against the rooftop edge and metal rail, followed by a solid landing impact and the runner's brief exerted breathing.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Fast electronic breakbeat at approximately  es 140 BPM, driven by tight kick drums, sharp hi-hats, and a pulsing bass synth. The rhythm intensifies during the jump and drops slightly on the final landing.", 1344, 768, 124, "FL2VA — 首尾帧生音视频", "native", 1, false, 0, true, "match", "official_2_to_15s", false], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 3, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "video_vae", "link": 4, "label": "video_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "video_vae"}, {"name": "audio_vae", "link": 5, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "drive_audio", "label": "drive_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "drive_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "final_audio", "label"